OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FFeeling cold
OL,6,Fas strong winds continue for a time
OL,7,Fthis evening with any isolated showers
OL,8,Fquickly dying out. These will ease
OL,9,Fthrough the night to leave some clear
OL,10,Fspells before cloud and rain push in
OL,11,Fagain towards dawn.
OL,12,
OL,13,CMonday:FRain to start, heavy and
OL,14,Fpersistent in places before dying out
OL,15,Fduring the afternoon leaving some
OL,16,Fbrighter spells. Winds strengthening
OL,17,Fagain through the morning,
OL,18,Fparticularly gusty over high ground.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
