OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FRain
OL,6,Fovernight into Tuesday, followed by
OL,7,Fstrong winds and scattered showers.
OL,8,FWinds somewhat easing into Wednesday
OL,9,Fto leave a bright, breezy day. Fog
OL,10,Fpatches overnight then dry and fine
OL,11,FThursday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
